        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Histopathological confirmation of spindle cells in sclerotic stroma with positive EMA immunostaining and clinical presentation of a slow-growing painless nodule",
    "notes": "Diagnosis relies heavily on histopathology and immunohistochemistry due to nonspecific clinical features."
